I fetch the food from the kitchen.
I put the large bowl of potato salad on the table.
Afterwards, I fetch the plate with the warm Bouletten.
"Wow, that smells fantastic!" says Lena.
"Help yourselves!" I say happily.
"Take the potato salad first, and then the meat."
Timo and Lena take some food.
Timo tries the first Boulette.
He nods enthusiastically.
"Maya, this is really delicious," he says.
Lena eats two Bouletten straight away.
"This is real Berlin food," she praises.
I am very happy about the compliment.
My first attempt is a complete success!
We open the cold beers.
"Cheers!" I say and raise my glass.
"To the delicious food and to you!" I call out.
"Cheers!"
Timo and Lena answer together.
We eat, drink, and talk the whole evening.
